# The build context of chain/Dockerfile is chain/. Cargo builds inside the image,
# so host build artifacts are never wanted, and they are many gigabytes.
**/target/
**/node_modules/

# A node's data directory, if one was ever made inside chain/ by hand: keys and
# chain state must never enter an image layer.
**/data/
**/keystore/
**/node-key
**/*.log
